   "subject": "Re: Reverse rainbow color scale from scale_colour_gradientn",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thank you Nicole, for your response and for links to some very interesting articles on the topic. I learned to use colorRampPalette not long after my post, and got it to work for me. Since I am making exploratory plots of temperature in the range of 12-20C, I think the rainbow (or rev(rainbow), in this case) will suffice. I will, however, give more thought to colors that I choose!<div>\r\n\r\n<br></div><div>Kevin</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Fri, Jul 12, 2013 at 4:56 PM, Nicole K.S. Barker <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">nicole.k...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,102,102)\">\r\nThe rainbow palette is generally not recommended (e.g., <a href=\"http://www.research.ibm.com/people/l/lloydt/color/color.HTM\" style=\"font-family:arial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.research.ibm.com/people/l/lloydt/color/color.HTM&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792372459759000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1M01_wPrRYRiHqAtOi-y_M\">http://www.research.ibm.com/people/l/lloydt/color/color.HTM</a>). </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,102,102)\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,102,102)\">You can make your own colour palette using the colorRampPalette function: <a href=\"http://www.inside-r.org/r-doc/grDevices/colorRampPalette\" style=\"font-family:arial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.inside-r.org/r-doc/grDevices/colorRampPalette&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792372459759000&amp;usg=AOvVaw34qZ2bFNA-5mk41Gnqgu9l\">http://www.inside-r.org/r-doc/grDevices/colorRampPalette</a></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,102,102)\">Here are some example colour schemes <a href=\"http://geography.uoregon.edu/datagraphics/color_scales.htm\" style=\"font-family:arial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.googl